  "_about": "BMW supercar-inspired Analog (Nov 18 2026). Fixed live oil temperature, oil pressure and coolant temperature on the left; 0-8000 rpm tachometer and gear in the centre; speed right; fuel percentage, outside temperature, drive mode and traction below. Dial red band follows configured redline. All units, cold/warning colours, held-value treatment and shift settings use the shared runtime. Gear-letter window and camera/turn-arrow clearance preserved. No brand badges. Fixed fields intentionally replace the previous configurable four arcs so all ten requested readings stay visible. Refined to match the concept: broad lightly slanted digits, open-bottom tach with dark gear hub, same-row telemetry, continuous bars, pictograms and dividers. openBottom/hubR are optional dial controls with unchanged defaults.",
